#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:782
msgid "Changes made by tool scripts and EditorScript (such as adding nodes or modifying properties) do **not** automatically mark the scene as unsaved. To show the asterisk ``(*)`` and prevent accidental data loss, call :ref:`EditorInterface.mark_scene_as_unsaved() <class_EditorInterface_method_mark_scene_as_unsaved>` after modifications, or use :ref:`EditorUndoRedoManager <class_EditorUndoRedoManager>` for undo support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:790
msgid "Using ``@tool`` improperly can yield many errors. It is advised to first write the code how you want it, and only then add the ``@tool`` annotation to the top. Also, make sure to separate code that runs in-editor from code that runs in-game. This way, you can find bugs more easily."
msgstr ""
